-+/*******************************************************************************
-+* mvCpuIfTargetWinGet - Get CPU-to-peripheral target address window
-+*
-+* DESCRIPTION:
-+*		Get the CPU peripheral target address window.
-+*
-+* INPUT:
-+*       target - Peripheral target enumerator
-+*
-+* OUTPUT:
-+*       pAddrDecWin - CPU target window information data structure.
-+*
-+* RETURN:
