-+/*******************************************************************************
-+* ethFreeDescrMemory - Free memory allocated for RX and TX descriptors.
-+*
-+* DESCRIPTION:
-+*       This function frees memory allocated for RX and TX descriptors.
-+*       - If ETH_DESCR_IN_SRAM defined, free memory using gtSramFree() function.
