-+/*******************************************************************************
-+* mvEthPortTxDone - Free all used Tx descriptors and mBlks.
-+*
-+* DESCRIPTION:
-+*       This routine returns the transmitted packet information to the caller.
-+*
-+* INPUT:
-+*       void*       pEthPortHndl    - Ethernet Port handler.
