-+*       MV_ERROR        - Unexpected Fatal error.
-+*       MV_OK           - There is transmitted packet in the queue,
-+*                       'pPktInfo' filled with relevant information.
-+*
-+*******************************************************************************/
-+static INLINE MV_PKT_INFO*    mvEthPortTxDone(void* pEthPortHndl, int txQueue)
