-+/*******************************************************************************
-+* twsiIntFlgClr - Clear Interrupt flag.
-+*
-+* DESCRIPTION:
-+*       This routine clears the interrupt flag. It does NOT poll the interrupt
-+*       to make sure the clear. After clearing the interrupt, it waits for at
-+*       least 1 miliseconds.
-+*
-+* INPUT:
-+*	chanNum - TWSI channel
-+*
-+* OUTPUT:
-+*       None.
-+*
-+* RETURN:
