-+/*******************************************************************************
-+* twsiInit - Initialize TWSI interface
-+*
-+* DESCRIPTION:
-+*       This routine:
-+*	-Reset the TWSI.
-+*	-Initialize the TWSI clock baud rate according to given frequancy
-+*	 parameter based on Tclk frequancy and enables TWSI slave.
