-+*	-Assign the TWSI slave address according to the TWSI address Type.
-+*
-+*
-+* INPUT:
-+*	chanNum - TWSI channel
-+*       frequancy - TWSI frequancy in KHz. (up to 100KHZ)
-+*
-+* OUTPUT:
